B7cobA=","id":"rs_01cb9e976cf8f0d8016a9a6d71ef3c87d0819f6217566323b9","summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"annotations":[{"end_index":310,"start_index":197,"title":"Current VAT rates","type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.revenue.ie/en/vat/vat-rates/search-vat-rates/current-VAT-rates.aspx?utm_source=openai"},{"end_index":648,"start_index":508,"title":"Budget 2026 Summary","type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.revenue.ie/en/corporate/press-office/budget-information/previous-years/2026/budget-summary.pdf?utm_source=openai"},{"end_index":1117,"start_index":1004,"title":"Current VAT rates","type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.revenue.ie/en/vat/vat-rates/search-vat-rates/current-VAT-rates.aspx?utm_source=openai"}],"logprobs":[],"text":"Short answer: Yes — Ireland’s standard VAT rate is 23% as of today (September 4, 2026), and that standard rate is the rate that normally applies to digital/electronic services supplied in Ireland. ([revenue.ie](https://www.revenue.ie/en/vat/vat-rates/search-vat-rates/current-VAT-rates.aspx?utm_source=openai))\n\nA couple of quick caveats:\n- Recent Budget changes (effective 2026) changed some hospitality/hairdressing rates to 9% but these are specific sectors and do not affect digital/electronic services. ([revenue.ie](https://www.revenue.ie/en/corporate/press-office/budget-information/previous-years/2026/budget-summary.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n- If you sell digital services to customers in other EU countries, VAT is generally charged at the customer’s country rate under the cross‑border B2C rules (that’s a separate matter if your pricing PDF covers non‑Irish customers). If you want, I can pull the specific Revenue guidance on cross‑border digital services for wording to add to your document. ([revenue.ie](https://www.revenue.ie/en/vat/vat-rates/search-vat-rates/current-VAT-rates.aspx?utm_source=openai))\n\nIf you’d like, upload the pricing PDF and I’ll check the exact line(s) and suggest a short updated wording or a citation you can paste into the document.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_01cb9e976cf8f0d8016a9a6d7ba30487d0b417f113fe0477f1","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"in_memory","reasoning":{"context":"current_turn","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","status":"completed","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":1}},"tools":[{"return_token_budget":"default","search_content_types":["text"],"search_context_size":"low","type":"web_search","user_location":{"city":null,"country":"US","region":null,"timezone":null,"type":"approximate"}}],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":1.0,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":9382,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":4736},"output_tokens":1600,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1472},"total_tokens":10982},"user":null},"durationMs":20652.90845790878,"headers":{"access-control-expose-headers":"X-Request-ID, CF-Ray, CF-Ray","alt-svc":"h3=\":443\"; ma=86400","cf-cache-status":"DYNAMIC","cf-ray":"a35b23748a0f6a9f-LAX","connection":"keep-alive","content-encoding":"gzip","content-type":"application/json","date":"Fri, 04 Sep 2026 07:04:30 GMT","openai-organization":"ben-mouqlz","openai-processing-ms":"20440","openai-project":"proj_6YFWNh4NzlKW1TydNdZL4ly2","openai-version":"2020-10-01","server":"cloudflare","set-cookie":"__cf_bm=Qm.5sPVTEP0y4dy3ZEsBE1IZXp3Vl9ZR1vGlMfJwn9c-1788505449.686371-1.0.1.1-zIof9tOlhUh9Q9V7BAvF7Re70C9iJJE7I_eS.OVzRYZnkwIkQY.cyNpgHOUtO7541Vygzgr1tnCTggJWgyvAd_eWisbuheHGtSrT..kxYw0tSiXlkX.dn